# Accepted occurrences of the patterns in internal-references.patterns.
# Format: path | excerpt | reason. Use * as the excerpt to accept a whole file.
eng/internal-references.patterns | * | defines the patterns
eng/internal-references.allowlist | * | lists the accepted occurrences
.gitignore | /docs/ | keeps the local-only documentation folder out of the repository
tests/WalterEgo.Architecture.Tests/InternalReferenceTests.cs | * | exercises the scanner with sample occurrences
